{
    "title": "Instacart: Get Food Delivery",
    "description": "Get food delivery and grocery orders delivered directly to your door in as fast as 30 minutes. Let Instacart connect you to your favorite food & drink spots, local grocery store or chain and get your goods in no time. Browse, shop, and eat with convenient grocery delivery in just a few taps! Plus, enjoy $0 delivery fee (service fees apply) on your first three grocery orders within 14 days of the first order.  Additional terms apply!\r\n\r\nEnjoy getting safe, contactless food delivery, including all of your grocery needs like your favorite healthy food, snacks, and essentials. Explore products from grocery stores around you and get them delivered to your doorstep. Save money and time by avoiding multiple trips to the grocery store.\r\n\r\nWith Instacart, you get the best of grocery and food technology services all in one easy to use app. Order food from fresh markets, drinks, and other household items online and get same-day delivery across the US. Prefer pick up? Make your grocery orders online, pick up at your local store, and skip the delivery fee. Download the app to see what supermarkets are available in your zip code.\r\n\r\nJust imagine what you can do with on-demand grocery delivery through Instacart! From getting deliveries in as fast as 30-minutes to grocery coupons to help you save \u2013 Instacart has it all. Download today and get started!\r\n\r\nShopping on Instacart is easy:\r\n\r\n1. Enter your zip code\r\n2. Shop online for fresh groceries, household items, electronics, and more\r\n3. Get exclusive discounts from local grocery store sales\r\n4. Add your items to your cart and place your order\r\n5. Chat with your shopper in real time to make any changes to your order\r\n6. Get your shopping delivered straight to your door or skip the delivery fee and pick up at the store\r\n\r\nINSTACART FEATURES\r\n\r\nGROCERY SHOPPING MADE EASY\r\n- Get your entire grocery store list delivered in as fast as 30 minutes\r\n- Food & drinks directly delivered straight to you, from grocery stores around you for convenient and fast shopping\r\n- Instacart goes beyond your usual grocery services with drinks and home essentials available\r\n- Get quick and safe orders with contactless delivery\r\n\r\nSAVE TIME WHILE SHOPPING\r\n- Skip visiting supermarkets and get more done with your day\r\n- From fresh produce late-night snacks and beverages \u2013 Instacart helps bring it all so you do more\r\n- Explore your grocery store from the comfort of your home and shop conveniently\r\n\r\nGROCERY COUPONS AND DEALS\r\n- Save money on some of your favorite products with Instacart\r\n- Discover exclusive deals and grocery coupons found only on the Instacart app\r\n- Shop grocery store sales and get the better prices on produce, snacks, and more\r\n\r\nSHOP GROCERY STORES NEAR YOU\r\n- Instacart connects you with over 85,000 supermarkets and stores across North America\r\n- Shop from your favorite stores \u2013 Aldi, Publix, Costco, Safeway and many more\r\n- You can also support local supermarkets. Simply browse and shop!\r\n\r\nInstacart helps bring you fresh products, savory snacks, cold beverages, and everything you need to complete your grocery shopping. Get even more perks with Instacart+.\r\n\r\nDownload Instacart today and discover a faster, safer, and more convenient way to shop at grocery stores.\r\n\r\nTerms and fees apply. See details: https://www.instacart.com/help/section/360007996832",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get food delivery and grocery orders delivered directly to your door in as fast as 30 minutes. Let Instacart connect you to your favorite food &amp; drink spots, local grocery store or chain and get your goods in no time. Browse, shop, and eat with convenient grocery delivery in just a few taps! Plus, enjoy $0 delivery fee (service fees apply) on your first three grocery orders within 14 days of the first order.  Additional terms apply!<br><br>Enjoy getting safe, contactless food delivery, including all of your grocery needs like your favorite healthy food, snacks, and essentials. Explore products from grocery stores around you and get them delivered to your doorstep. Save money and time by avoiding multiple trips to the grocery store.<br><br>With Instacart, you get the best of grocery and food technology services all in one easy to use app. Order food from fresh markets, drinks, and other household items online and get same-day delivery across the US. Prefer pick up? Make your grocery orders online, pick up at your local store, and skip the delivery fee. Download the app to see what supermarkets are available in your zip code.<br><br>Just imagine what you can do with on-demand grocery delivery through Instacart! From getting deliveries in as fast as 30-minutes to grocery coupons to help you save \u2013 Instacart has it all. Download today and get started!<br><br>Shopping on Instacart is easy:<br><br>1. Enter your zip code<br>2. Shop online for fresh groceries, household items, electronics, and more<br>3. Get exclusive discounts from local grocery store sales<br>4. Add your items to your cart and place your order<br>5. Chat with your shopper in real time to make any changes to your order<br>6. Get your shopping delivered straight to your door or skip the delivery fee and pick up at the store<br><br>INSTACART FEATURES<br><br>GROCERY SHOPPING MADE EASY<br>- Get your entire grocery store list delivered in as fast as 30 minutes<br>- Food &amp; drinks directly delivered straight to you, from grocery stores around you for convenient and fast shopping<br>- Instacart goes beyond your usual grocery services with drinks and home essentials available<br>- Get quick and safe orders with contactless delivery<br><br>SAVE TIME WHILE SHOPPING<br>- Skip visiting supermarkets and get more done with your day<br>- From fresh produce late-night snacks and beverages \u2013 Instacart helps bring it all so you do more<br>- Explore your grocery store from the comfort of your home and shop conveniently<br><br>GROCERY COUPONS AND DEALS<br>- Save money on some of your favorite products with Instacart<br>- Discover exclusive deals and grocery coupons found only on the Instacart app<br>- Shop grocery store sales and get the better prices on produce, snacks, and more<br><br>SHOP GROCERY STORES NEAR YOU<br>- Instacart connects you with over 85,000 supermarkets and stores across North America<br>- Shop from your favorite stores \u2013 Aldi, Publix, Costco, Safeway and many more<br>- You can also support local supermarkets. Simply browse and shop!<br><br>Instacart helps bring you fresh products, savory snacks, cold beverages, and everything you need to complete your grocery shopping. Get even more perks with Instacart+.<br><br>Download Instacart today and discover a faster, safer, and more convenient way to shop at grocery stores.<br><br>Terms and fees apply. See details: https://www.instacart.com/help/section/360007996832",
